the assassin's creed series tells an  alternative history of the creation and  development of human civilization  and it all ties back to an ancient super  advanced species  that ruled over earth long before the  assassins and templars even  existed spanning over a dozen games the  lore of this massively beloved series is  vast  but the semi-magical throughline of all  assassin's creed games and the age-old  battle over ancient technology is  secretive  and altogether more complex there will  be spoilers ahead but let's dive in  and see where this series and the origin  of humanity  all began  long before humanity's existence there  were those who came before  the first civilization that ruled earth  over 77  000 years ago were called the isu the  isu were a super advanced ancient race  of humanoids  that were better than humans in just  about every way  with longer life spans sixth senses  instead of five  and even triple helix dna structure even  though they seem a bit like aliens  they were native to earth and were a  result of thousands of years of  evolution  but their origins are still somewhat  unclear the issue created and bred  an obedient simple-minded race of  creatures to use as an  enslaved workforce humans early humans  couldn't really comprehend the isu  and their intelligence so they viewed  the isu as gods  humans were built to survive but they  weren't intended to be very smart  in fact the isu also created  neanderthals to use as a military force  however to keep humanity under control  the isu crafted technologies known as  pieces of eden  these are a collection of powerful  devices that tap into human brains  through a network of neurotransmitters  to ensure their total obedience these  pieces of eden include king arthur's  sword excalibur  the crystal skulls and the broken spear  of leonidas some pieces of eden are used  for mind control but others can  empower the person using it the swords  of eden grant leadership and charisma  and the shrouds of eden grant powers of  healing and restoration  pieces of eden have been utilized to  help some of the most influential  leaders in history  including genghis khan napoleon and  gandhi  these are the items the assassins and  templars have been fighting over  for centuries the templar order hopes to  exploit the pieces of eden to help them  achieve  a new world order while their enemies  the assassins  seek to guard them but there are certain  humans born without the  neurotransmitters that give pieces of  eden their power  making them immune to the artifact's  mind control abilities  these are human isu hybrids hybrids and  their subsequent bloodlines have an  extra sensory perception  or a sixth sense called eagle vision  also known as odin's sight by viking  assassins  not only did altair ezio bayek and many  other noteworthy assassins have this  hyper awareness  but the sense was also possessed by the  first known hybrids  adam and eve in an ancient isu city  referred to as the garden of eden adam  and eve using their hybrid ability to  resist mind control  stole an apple of eden which doesn't  actually look like an apple at all  this rebellion erupted into a full-scale  war between humans and their so-called  gods the issue  in 75010 bce the first civilization was  more technologically advanced  but humans had the advantage of numbers  big numbers with millions more human  fighters compared to their creators  this civil war went on for a decade with  much higher casualties than the issue  expected  but they were so distracted fighting the  war that they failed to notice an  impending disaster approaching earth  a massive solar flare a small group of  isu referred to as the capital line  triad  who when participating in the war  attempted to prevent the solar flare  the trio made up of minerva juno and  jupiter tried to find possible solutions  and tested them in underground temples  called vols but ultimately  all of them failed after accepting their  fate minerva decided to dedicate herself  to preventing the inevitable  reoccurrence of a solar flare in the  future  while juno focused on her own more  sinister plans  juno didn't exactly want to save earth  she wanted to conquer it  and make humans pay for daring to revolt  against their creators  when minerva and jupiter discovered  juno's motives they quickly  imprisoned her in what is essentially  limbo  as the solar flare approached earth  minerva finally managed to find a  solution to prevent future solar flares  she constructed a pedestal called the  eye that had the power to alter the  patterns and equations of existence  to protect the earth and leave hidden  messages of warning for future humans  but before minerva could use the device  she discovered juno had tampered with it  so that it would set her free from  imprisonment upon activation  refusing to unleash juno maneuver  destroyed the device  sealing the earth's fate to face the  solar flare  when the disaster struck a massive  eruption of magma from the surface of  the sun  flipped the earth's weakened magnetic  field reversing its polarity and  exposing the earth to the sun's  radiation  this event the toba catastrophe scorched  the planet and wiped out the majority of  life on earth  including most of the isu and humans but  not all of them  sometime after the toba catastrophe the  son of adam and eve  kane killed his brother abel to take the  apple of eden previously possessed by  their parents  to pay for his crime kane was branded  with a red cross  which his followers named the mark of  kane hundreds of years later the mark of  cain was adopted as the insignia of the  children of kane's future incarnation  the knights templar after the war and  the toba catastrophe the isu and humans  worked together to rebuild their world  but the isu weren't able to fully  rebuild their population  leading to the inevitable decline toward  their extinction  however they knew another solar flare  would occur eventually  so it took steps to prevent it minerva  built a second eye device and recorded  hologram messages of warning in a vault  underneath what would become  vatican city in rome in these messages  maneuver warned of earth's impending  doom  and spoke of the temples that could save  earth from destruction  built by those who knew to turn away  from war only a hundred years after the  temples were built  the first civilization was almost  completely extinct  and this message was one of the last  remaining vestiges of the first  civilization  after the issue faded into obscurity the  first instance of a modern human  discovering their existence  was by a descendant of adam altair it  wasn't for 300 more years that humanity  would encounter them again  when a descendant of altair the assassin  ezio auditory deference  found minerva's hologram underneath the  vatican ezio told the other assassins  about minerva but they didn't really  understand her true nature and power  even ezio seemed to have a hard time  rationalizing her existence  500 years after ezio his descendant  desmond miles was forced by abstergo  industries  to receive minerva's messages through  the memories of altair and ezio  at the end of assassin's creed iii  desmond bravely sacrificed himself  using the eye pedestal to save the world  but in doing so he unleashed  juno from her imprisonment into the  digital world  to wreak havoc under the guise of saving  humans from themselves  which sounds a lot like thanos but don't  worry juno hasn't been able to achieve  her goal  for now i will save you all  while we don't know too much about  assassin's creed valhalla yet fans are  already speculating the ways the isu and  the pieces of eden could play a role in  the next installment of the popular  series  in valhalla we'll be playing as vikings  but of course every assassin's creed  game involves elements of sorcery  intertwined with earth's  alternative history in the series law  the isu seem to have directly influenced  different polytheistic religions  since many of them have the same names  as roman gods like minerva  juno and jupiter it becomes even more  apparent in assassin's creed origins and  odyssey  when it's revealed that the egyptian and  greek gods are also  actually isu it seems possible that  valhalla could include the isu  as the norse gods like odin thor loki or  freya  in norse mythology valhalla means the  hall of the slain  and is an enormous majestic hall in  asgard ruled by the god odin  the legend says that when warriors died  in combat odin chose the best fighters  and sent valkyries to lead them to  valhalla upon dying so they can aid odin  during the battles of ragnarok  the whole ceiling was thatched with  golden shields and was surrounded by  legendary creatures and the golden tree  glacier  it seems possible that there might be  norse pieces of eden in assassin's creed  valhalla  or even a humanity threatening event  like ragnarok but we'll just have to  keep waiting until november  to find out  for more on assassin's creed valhalla  and other episodes of law escape  including ones on the witcher 3 and the  sims  make sure you keep your eyes peeled to  youtube.com gamespot  this is lucy james reading for miranda  church
 

